 "deductions:deductions.d_friday.options.3": "⟦Lõõšéñîñg thé héàtér’š éxhàüšt àñd tàpîñg õvér thé àlàrm⟧",
 "deductions:deductions.d_friday.proofLabels.0": "⟦Hé wàš àt Mõšš⟧",
